The '''Mos Pelgo saloon'''<ref name="Art of Mando 2">[[The Art of Star Wars: The Mandalorian (Season Two)|''The Art of Star Wars: The Mandalorian'' Season Two]]</ref> was a cantina located in [[Freetown]], formerly known as Mos Pelgo, on the [[planet]] [[Tatooine]]. It was operated by the [[Weequay]] [[Taanti]].<ref name="Chapter 6" />

In [[4 ABY]],<ref name="Galactic Atlas">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref> shortly after the [[Battle of Endor]], the people from the city celebrated the destruction of the [[DS-2 Death Star II Mobile Battle Station|second Death Star]] at the cantina, when unexpectedly, the [[Mining Collective]] arrived and attacked the saloon.<ref name="Chapter 9">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 9: The Marshal}}</ref>

In [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{MandoDate|9}}</ref> the [[Mandalorian]] [[Din Djarin]] arrived at the cantina while he was looking for [[Marshal]] [[Cobb Vanth]]. Then Vanth entered, and while speaking with Djarin, ordered [[spotchka]] to drink. Shortly after, Djarin and Vanth held a meeting at the cantina with the population of Mos Pelgo to talk about a proposed partnership with a group of [[Tusken Raider]]s to defeat a [[krayt dragon]].<ref name="Chapter 9" />

